{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52546","headline":"云龙 · 陈元光","name":"云龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾坤成列神流通，纯阳附阴生神龙。\n伸屈妙运参帝功，一鼓絪緼油云从。\n飞翔四海雨域[中]（十），万汇焦枯仰化融。\n苦时潜德来奋踪，羣生渴想心忡忡。\n雷鸣云起德斯普，变化循环自今古。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}